  "_elite_note": "Any ordinary (non-boss) pack member may roll elite on each spawn. An elite is a stronger copy of the same species with its own label colour, more experience and an extra guaranteed loot roll.",
  "elite": {
    "chance": 0.03,
    "hp_mult": 3.0,
    "attack_mult": 1.5,
    "exp_mult": 3.0,
    "name_prefix": "Elite "
  },
  "_level_gap_note": "Metin2-style level gap. diff = mob level - player level. Experience and loot drop chances are scaled by the first band whose `min_diff` the diff reaches (bands sorted high to low).",
  "level_gap": {
    "bands": [
      {
        "min_diff": 8,
        "exp": 1.2,
        "drop": 1.0
      },
      {
        "min_diff": -5,
        "exp": 1.0,
        "drop": 1.0
      },
      {
        "min_diff": -9,
        "exp": 0.6,
        "drop": 0.7
      },
      {
        "min_diff": -14,
        "exp": 0.25,
        "drop": 0.35
      },
      {
        "min_diff": -999,
        "exp": 0.05,
        "drop": 0.1
      }
    ]
  },
  "_exp_note": "exp_mult scales the level-based pack experience for creatures that are slower to kill than their level suggests (trolls, dementors).",
  "_abilities_note": "abilities: telegraphed patterns an ordinary creature mixes in (`every` N attacks) or throws at a target out of reach (`min_range`/`max_range` + `cooldown`). at_target centres the area on the target; despair_s stops the victim's regeneration; drain heals the attacker by that share of the damage. aura: while fighting, players within `radius` take attack_power x damage_ratio per regeneration beat and despair. push/lift: shove each victim (m/s away from the attacker, and up) - the pixie's lift. poison {ratio, ticks, interval_ms}: venom on every victim, attack_power x ratio per beat on the burn clock (authority apply_poison). web_s: the victim moves at half speed on foot for that long (apply_web, player.gd WEBBED_FACTOR).",
  "_parts_note": "D1 multi-part creatures: `parts` names the bones a body grows targetable parts on (their species and hit points come from the part's own entry and boss_overrides part_hp). The body is immune while any part stands. `front_guard`: share of a blow from in front (~60 degrees) that a shield-bearer ignores.",
  "_displace_note": "displace_resist: how much of a throw (Bombarda, Expelliarmus) a creature shrugs off, 1.0 = never moves. Bosses are never thrown. Ability riders on players: stun_s (no casts, no steering), push/lift (thrown: no casts until it lands), web_s (slowed), poison, despair_s."
}
